{
  "id": "fluency-l10-inside-function",
  "lesson": "l10-inside-function",
  "title": "Fluency: the chain rule",
  "n": 20,
  "pass": 0.9,
  "minutes": 10,
  "families": [
    {
      "id": "linear-inside",
      "weight": 2,
      "skill": "differentiate a power of a linear bracket",
      "vars": {
        "a": { "int": [-6, 6], "not": [0] },
        "b": { "int": [-9, 9], "not": [0] },
        "np": { "pick": [[2, ""], [3, "^{2}"], [4, "^{3}"], [5, "^{4}"], [6, "^{5}"], [7, "^{6}"], [8, "^{7}"]], "as": ["n", "pw"] }
      },
      "let": { "n1": "n - 1", "na": "n*a" },
      "prompt": "Find $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{dx}}$ when $y = ({a:c}x{b:+})^{n}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "expression", "answer": "{na}({a:c}x{b:+}){pw}", "keyboard": "calculus" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "inside-forgotten", "tex": "{n}({a:c}x{b:+}){pw}", "line": "You forgot to multiply by the inside's derivative, {a}.", "when": "a != 1" },
        { "id": "power-not-lowered", "tex": "{na}({a:c}x{b:+})^{{{n}}}", "line": "You multiplied by {n} but did not lower the power to {n1}." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "The outside is $u^{n}$ with $u = {a:c}x{b:+}$, so $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{du}} = {n}u{pw}$ and $\\dfrac{{du}}{{dx}} = {a}$.",
        "Multiply: $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{dx}} = {n}({a:c}x{b:+}){pw} \\times {a:()} = {na}({a:c}x{b:+}){pw}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "square-inside",
      "weight": 2,
      "skill": "differentiate a power of a quadratic bracket",
      "vars": {
        "a": { "int": [-5, 5], "not": [0] },
        "b": { "int": [-9, 9], "not": [0] },
        "np": { "pick": [[2, ""], [3, "^{2}"], [4, "^{3}"], [5, "^{4}"], [6, "^{5}"]], "as": ["n", "pw"] }
      },
      "let": { "n1": "n - 1", "a2": "2*a", "k": "2*a*n" },
      "prompt": "Find $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{dx}}$ when $y = ({poly(x; a, 0, b)})^{n}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "expression", "answer": "{k}x({poly(x; a, 0, b)}){pw}", "keyboard": "calculus" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "inside-forgotten", "tex": "{n}({poly(x; a, 0, b)}){pw}", "line": "You forgot to multiply by the inside's derivative, ${a2}x$." },
        { "id": "x-dropped", "tex": "{k}({poly(x; a, 0, b)}){pw}", "line": "The inside's derivative is ${a2}x$, not {a2}: keep the $x$." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "The outside is $u^{n}$ with $u = {poly(x; a, 0, b)}$, so $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{du}} = {n}u{pw}$ and $\\dfrac{{du}}{{dx}} = {a2}x$.",
        "Multiply: $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{dx}} = {k}x({poly(x; a, 0, b)}){pw}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "root-inside",
      "weight": 1,
      "skill": "differentiate a square root of a bracket",
      "vars": {
        "a": { "int": [1, 9] },
        "b": { "int": [1, 9] }
      },
      "let": { "a2": "2*a" },
      "prompt": "Find $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{dx}}$ when $y = \\sqrt{{{poly(x; a, 0, b)}}}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "expression", "answer": "\\frac{{{a:c}x}}{{\\sqrt{{{poly(x; a, 0, b)}}}}}", "keyboard": "calculus" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "inside-forgotten", "tex": "\\frac{{1}}{{2\\sqrt{{{poly(x; a, 0, b)}}}}}", "line": "You forgot to multiply by the inside's derivative, ${a2}x$." },
        { "id": "half-dropped", "tex": "\\frac{{{a2}x}}{{\\sqrt{{{poly(x; a, 0, b)}}}}}", "line": "You dropped the $\\tfrac{{1}}{{2}}$ that the power $\\tfrac{{1}}{{2}}$ brings down." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "Write $y = u^{{1/2}}$ with $u = {poly(x; a, 0, b)}$, so $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{du}} = \\dfrac{{1}}{{2\\sqrt{{u}}}}$ and $\\dfrac{{du}}{{dx}} = {a2}x$.",
        "Multiply: $\\dfrac{{dy}}{{dx}} = \\dfrac{{{a2}x}}{{2\\sqrt{{{poly(x; a, 0, b)}}}}} = \\dfrac{{{a:c}x}}{{\\sqrt{{{poly(x; a, 0, b)}}}}}$."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
